ts include configuring HTML attributes such as: 'aria-describedby', 'autocomplete' (hinting what data to auto-fill according to the user's browser settings), and others. Introduces a Computed Field feature, to configure a determined value for form field for typical usage, but if failing validation checks on that condition the value can determined by user response on a resubmit. The Override feature allows for both setting defaults, or conditional defaults for both fields and for form control HTML attributes. A notable extension, included here, is displaying different label and help text for address form fields to adjust between assuming a local country postal format vs. a more international format while adding a country field (but only when needed). ","topics":[],"score":278107,"global_rank":45535,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6721},{"name":"ianyepan/bitcoin-price-alert","owner":"ianyepan","html_url":"https://github.com/ianyepan/bitcoin-price-alert","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Automatically refreshes the current Bitcoin price and plays \"You Suffer\" by Napalm Death every time it detects a price drop; and plays a cheerful notification whenever the price goes up. (Inspired by HBO series: Silicon Valley)","topics":[],"score":278105,"global_rank":34334,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6722},{"name":"reskillamericans/MuseumExperience-Group2-Python-BE","owner":"reskillamericans","html_url":"https://github.com/reskillamericans/MuseumExperience-Group2-Python-BE","stars":1,"forks":2,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":278102,"global_rank":34337,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6723},{"name":"spyoungtech/breachman","owner":"spyoungtech","html_url":"https://github.com/spyoungtech/breachman","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A puzzle game inspired by the Cyberpunk 2077 breaching protocol minig